####################    git    #################################

-- my aliases --
gitstat		git status -s
gitup [msg]	add-all + commit (msg or "auto update") + push
gitall		status over every repo under $gitRoot
gitsrc		print remote.origin.url of this repo
gitorphen	list .md files/folders not linked from readme.md
git.brief	commit msg for ./ changes: subject + up to 4 bullets (claude)
		  gitup "$(git.brief)"  -> commit + push with it
git.sol		restart ssh-agent + load github key
git.keys	list loaded ssh keys (ssh-add -l)
mygit		cd $gitRoot + load github key

keys live in gensys/secrets/ssh/ (never committed) — if a
push asks for a password, run git.sol first.

-- recipes --

merge from main on local
========================
git pull origin main


update on main all branches
===========================
git fetch -a



compare between local branch and remote one
===========================================
git difftool  <branch>:./<path>  <path>
